This project contains a reduced and modified training implementation derived
from Step1X-3D, distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

The files under training/uni3d/ and evaluation/uni3d/ are reduced and modified
from BAAI-Vision/Uni3D. They retain the upstream MIT license in
training/uni3d/LICENSE and evaluation/uni3d/LICENSE. The two subsets are kept
separate for the frozen REPA training teacher and Uni3D-I evaluation.

The minimal PointBERT inference implementation in evaluation/ulip_model.py is
adapted from Salesforce/ULIP and retains the upstream BSD 3-Clause license in
evaluation/LICENSE-ULIP.

Parts of the transformer implementation are adapted from Hugging Face
Diffusers. See source-file notices and the upstream project for details.

No model weights or external datasets are distributed in this source archive.
Their separate licenses and terms must be reviewed before redistribution. The
synthetic cube under data/demo_3d_data is generated specifically for this
repository and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.

The ROAD overview image under assets/000.png and the selected conditioning
images, textured GLBs, and renders under assets/showcase/ are distributed as
project showcase assets under the Apache License 2.0 unless noted otherwise.
